Layer 2 reverts the whole batch only on the one transition a checker can speak to: it passed before the edit and failed after it.

```console
$ lets edit usage.ts --old 'usageCap' --new 'usageLimit' --all --check 'grep -q usageCap {}'
? 3
command check failed for usage.ts: `grep -q usageCap {}` passed before the batch and failed after it · 1 file reverted
ERROR_CODE=check_failed

```
